# Local agent instructions

## Scope and local differences

These instructions apply only to REPLACE_WITH_SUBTREE. Repository-root instructions remain applicable according to the selected platform, except for the explicit local differences below.

- Technology or ownership: REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_DIFFERENCE.
- Generated files: REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_GENERATOR_OR_NONE.
- Safety boundary: REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_BOUNDARY_OR_INHERITED.

## Local commands and completion

- Local focused check: `REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_FOCUSED_COMMAND`
- Local completion check: `REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_COMPLETION_COMMAND`

## Local references

- When changing REPLACE_WITH_AREA, read [the local contract](REPLACE_WITH_REFERENCE) for REPLACE_WITH_PURPOSE.
